She who has the immeasurable body
##210\. mahAlakShmI \-##
She who is the great goddess lakShmI
##211\. mR^iDapriyA \-##
She who is the beloved of mRiDa (shiva)
##212\. mahArUpA \-##
She who has a great form
##213\. mahApUjyA \-##
She who is the greatest object of worship
##214\. mahApAtakanAshinI \-##
