She who is effulgent
##394\. prabhArUpA \-##
She who is effulgence
##395\. prasiddhA \-##
She who is celebrated
##396\. parameshvarI \-##
She who is the supreme sovereign
##397\. mUlaprakR^itiH \-##
She who is the first cause of the entire universe
##398\. avyaktA \-##
